{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classic Indian game Carrom is now available to play in Carrom Slam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carrom,\u00a0to those unfamiliar with the game, is most similar to 8-ball billiards. Players take turns shooting the striker from their baseline attempting to pocket coins the corners of the board. The red piece, or queen, must be pocketed and covered before the game ends, and is worth a high value of points. The round ends when one team sinks all of their pieces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417650/extras/f03ac1fc05b6532953a9146cc6336851.poster.avif?t=1761066019\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417650/extras/f03ac1fc05b6532953a9146cc6336851.webm?t=1761066019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417650/extras/f03ac1fc05b6532953a9146cc6336851.mp4?t=1761066019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4+ player matches (browser, steam friends, and/or bots)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 game modes (professional, points, disc pool, blitz, sandbox, bowling, and training)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable rules, point values, board dimensions, and striker designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive tutorial</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417650/extras/b7a35c4707b40e50f12f3a930e8492ce.poster.avif?t=1761066019\" width=1080 height=1080 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417650/extras/b7a35c4707b40e50f12f3a930e8492ce.w